"`Putty <http://www.putty.org/>`__ and use a command like below:"
msgstr ""
"使用 *scp* 将 **ArduCopter-v2.px4** 文件从您的电脑复制到 **root@10.1.1.10:/firmware** "
"（即 Solo 飞行器 IMX6 上的固件目录）。Windows 用户可考虑安装 `Putty "
"<http://www.putty.org/>`__ 并使用类似以下的命令："

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:43 4ce55122af0a44c9aad36f98d0346619
msgid ""
"The SSH-PASSWORD should be replaced with the actual ssh password for your"
" vehicle. The default root password is TjSDBkAu."
msgstr "SSH-PASSWORD 应替换为您飞行器的实际 SSH 密码，默认 root 密码为 TjSDBkAu。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:47 327ba7d434f04d7c9690913d3d1252e7
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Reboot the vehicle and the vehicle's IMX6 should load the firmware onto "
"the Pixhawk 2.1 (CubePilot CubeBlack) (you should see the regular rainbow"
" colours on the arm LEDs as the upload proceeds)."
msgstr "重启飞行器，IMX6 应将固件加载到 Pixhawk2（上传过程中机臂 LED 应显示正常的彩虹颜色）。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:50 60666c80ed8e441283ef659ee89d9364
msgid ""
"After uploading the firmware is moved to the **/firmware/loaded** "
"directory."
msgstr "上传完成后，固件将被移至 **/firmware/loaded** 目录。"

